`P = cartLieSum hhStep3.gen hhStep2.out hhStep3.order`
and `Q = hhStep3.out`,
replayed in 25 chunks of 200 monomials (`ChunkMerge`), each chunk a separate
`decide +kernel` theorem. Generated by `docs/tracks/B/b3/producer/gen_chunks.py`; do not edit.
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

namespace KAM.EffectiveStability.HenonHeiles

open CartPoly

/-- The trimmed unmerged difference checked by shard Lie3. -/
def hhLie3Y : List (CartMonoK QSqrt2) :=
